  "question": {
    "text": "Calculate heat of atomization of furan in KJmol<sup>-1</sup> using the data<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/4605s111.png\" style=\"width: 213px; height: 71px;\" /><br />\r<br />\rHeats of atomization of C, H, O are 717, 218, 249 KJmol<sup>-1</sup> each. Fill your answer dividing by 100&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "40.51",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Writing the formation reaction<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>4</mn><mtext>C</mtext><mfenced> <mtext>s</mtext> </mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>H</mtext><mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mfenced><mo>+</mo><mtext>O</mtext><mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mfenced><mo>→</mo><msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext><mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>Δ</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>f</mtext> <mo>∘</mo> </msubsup> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mn>2</mn> <mo>·</mo> <mn>0</mn> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mtext>Σ</mtext> <mtext>reac</mtext> </msub> <mtext>BE</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mtext>Σ</mtext> <mtext>product</mtext> </msub> <mtext>BE</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>Σ</mtext> <mtext>product</mtext> </msub> <mtext>&nbsp;BE</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mtext>Σ</mtext> <mtext>reac</mtext> </msub> <mtext>BE</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mn>2</mn> <mo>·</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mo>×</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mn>1</mn> <mn>7</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mo>×</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>1</mn> <mn>8</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>4</mn> <mn>9</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>8</mn> <mn>6</mn> <mn>8</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>8</mn> <mn>7</mn> <mn>2</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>4</mn> <mn>9</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mn>2</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mn>0</mn>&nbsp;<mn>5</mn> <mn>1</mn> <mtext>&nbsp;KJ</mtext> <msup> <mtext>&nbsp;mol</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>Σ</mtext> <mtext>product</mtext> </msub> <mtext>&nbsp;BE</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;is heat of atomization of product into isolated gaseous atoms.&nbsp;<br /><br />Hence answer is 40.51",
